---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" description="ALTR's mission and the people behind it.">
  <section class="pt-40 pb-20 px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">About ALTR</p>
      <h1 class="reveal mt-4 font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">
        A church that comes to you
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal mt-6 text-lg text-[color:var(--color-muted)]">
        A church that meets you where you are, inviting you 
        to explore faith, find authentic community, and experience 
        church in a whole new way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="reveal card p-8 md:p-14 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">
          See Faith Differently
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[color:var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          At ALTR, we believe faith was never meant to fit in a box — or a building. 
          We exist to meet people exactly where they are: in their scrolling, their 
          searching, their doubting, and their believing. We're here to reimagine 
          what church can be in a way that feels authentic, accessible, and alive — 
          no matter where they are or what they've been through. 
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO WE ARE -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-28">
    <div class="reveal mb-10">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">Streamers, students, and the terminally online</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="reveal card p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">Started small</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          ALTR began as a physical church who wanted to expand its outreach to the 
          digital realm. We are a small team looking to share the gospel in a new
          way.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal card p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">Led by community</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Our team is made up of moderators, small-group hosts, and
          volunteers who show up in the Discord as much as they show up
          on stream. No one here is just a face on a screen.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal card p-7">
        <p class="font-display text-xl text-[color:var(--color-paper)]">Built to last</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          We're not chasing a platform or a trend. We're building
          something durable — relationships that outlast the algorithm
          that first brought you here.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Statement of Faith -->
